abstract: >-
  ait turns Claude Code, Codex CLI, Aider, Gemini CLI, and Cursor
  runs into isolated, reviewable attempts with provenance, shared
  repo memory, cross-agent handoff, adversarial review, and explicit
  apply/recover on top of Git. Metadata stays local under .ait/ —
  no SaaS, no telemetry. Open source under MIT, dependency-free
  Python 3.14+, distributed as ait-vcs on PyPI and npm.
